[00:22.70]1. Jehovah, our Father in heaven,
[00:45.40]Oh, this is a most sacred night!
[00:51.93]It was then, long ago, you determined to show
[01:00.41]Your love, justice, wisdom, and might.
[01:08.25]The Passover lamb gave protection,
[01:16.25]And your favored people were freed.
[01:24.67]Cent’ries later our Lord his own lifeblood outpoured
[01:35.32]To fulfill this divine prophecy.
[01:45.98]2. The bread and the wine are reminders,
[01:56.64]How great is the price that you paid.
[02:02.91]And the good that was done
[02:09.19]through the gift of your Son,
[02:15.47]In life and in death he obeyed.
[02:21.75]We gratefully keep this Memorial;
[02:28.03]This night is a time to recall
[02:36.09]How the death of your Son
[02:40.09]paid the ransom that won
[02:44.09]The redemption from death for us all.
[02:55.31]3. We’re gathered together before you.
[03:06.52]At your invitation we’ve come
[03:14.01]To give praise for your love that brought
[03:18.62]Christ from above
[03:23.23]And honor to you and your Son.
[03:31.20]The Lord’s Ev’ning Meal brings you glory
[03:40.22]And strengthens our heart and our mind.
[03:47.86]So we’ll walk ev’ry day as Christ showed us the way,
[04:00.96]And then life everlasting we’ll find.